<title>JAPAN: Japan July green coffee imports down 6.12% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan July green coffee imports down 6.12% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's green coffee imports in July totalled 29,355 tonnes, down by 6.12 percent from the same month a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Imports of roasted coffee amounted to 268 tonnes in July against 331 tonnes the same month a year earlier.</p>
<p>The breakdown is as follows (in tonnes)</p>
<p>		   July 96	 June 96	  July 95</p>
<p> Total	   29,355	   29,121	   31,269</p>
<p> Indonesia	6,480		nil	    5,174</p>
<p> Colombia	 4,865	    4,901	    5,573</p>
</text>
